# Suvo demo playlist for app-store / LG webOS review.
# Served at https://suvo.tv/demo-playlist.m3u (Cloudflare, docs/site assets).
# Add in-app via: Accounts -> Add -> "M3U playlist" -> paste the URL above.
#
# Exercises every content type + both declared streaming protocols:
#   "Suvo Demo Live (HLS)"        -> live   / .m3u8  -> HLS
#   "Big Buck Bunny (Sample)"     -> movie  / .mp4   -> HTTP/HTTPS progressive download
#   "Suvo Demo Series S01E01/02"  -> series / .mp4   -> HTTP/HTTPS progressive download
#
# Royalty-free public test streams only. No broadcaster names, no bundled channels.
# Verify all entries play in the app before submitting (public test URLs can rotate).
